40
00:02:03.617 --> 00:02:26.634
The Mekong is a long river. It starts high in the mountains as a little stream. Malis walks on a riverbank path and sees the dry stream bed in the hot season. The current is strong, and there are rapids in the north. In the rainy season, water covers the floodplain. Malis takes a boat trip to a fishing village. Finally, the river reaches the delta and the sea.

